DESCRIPTION:Join us for an immersive journey that combines physicality\, cr
 eativity\, and storytelling to explore the powerful connection between bod
 y\, mind\, and social space. Gain fresh perspectives and experience our in
 novative approach to transforming complex social issues into beautiful\, e
 mbodied poetic stories on stage. This unique creative experience will help
  you develop body awareness\, self-expression\, voice\, confidence\, and a
 cting skills\, while strengthening social connections. You’ll be welcome
 d into the D.I.V.E. Collective’s training space\, taking part in the sam
 e warm-ups\, exercises\, and creative routines we use to prepare for our p
 erformances.
